    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\nSimilarly to `po:Inline`, elements following the 'atom' pattern can only be contained within block or inline elements (and consequently they also cannot be used as root elements of documents). \nIt can contain textual content and no other elements.\n    "
